page("privacy.html","Privacy Policy | Cram Vault","Cram Vault privacy policy.","""<h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p>Effective October 28, 2026.</p><h2>Data we process</h2><p>Lecture audio, transcripts, flashcards and notes are created and stored on your device. Microphone, speech recognition and camera access are used only when you start a recording or scan. If you enable iCloud sync, data is stored in your private iCloud account, which we cannot access. Optional AI generation sends transcript text over an encrypted connection to generate study material; it is not used to train models and is not retained after processing.</p><h2>Purchases</h2><p>Subscriptions are processed by Apple. We receive no payment card details.</p><h2>Analytics</h2><p>We may collect anonymous, aggregated crash and usage diagnostics. We do not sell personal data or use it for third-party advertising tracking.</p><h2>Children</h2><p>Cram Vault is not directed at children under 13.</p><h2>Your rights &amp; deletion</h2><p>Delete any lecture in the app, or delete all data in Settings › Delete All Data. Contact support@cramvault.app for access or deletion requests (GDPR/CCPA).</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>support@cramvault.app</p>""",[ORG])
page("terms.html","Terms of Use | Cram Vault","Cram Vault terms of use and subscription terms.","""<h1>Terms of Use</h1><p>Effective October 28, 2026. By using Cram Vault you agree to these terms and Apple’s Standard EULA (https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/).</p><h2>Recording consent</h2><p>You are responsible for obtaining permission to record lectures where required by law or your institution.</p><h2>Subscriptions</h2><p>Cram Vault Pro is an auto-renewable subscription. Payment is charged to your Apple ID at confirmation. It renews automatically unless cancelled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period; your account is charged for renewal within 24 hours before the end of the period. Manage or cancel in Settings › Apple ID › Subscriptions. Unused free-trial time is forfeited on purchase.</p><h2>Academic integrity</h2><p>Use Cram Vault in line with your school’s policies. AI-generated content may contain errors; verify important information.</p><h2>Liability</h2><p>The app is provided “as is” to the extent permitted by law.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>support@cramvault.app</p>""",[ORG])
